<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Inductive Bias Ablations</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">On the Othello dataset, we perform ablation of the IB metrics on the number of fine-tuning iterations
(<a href="#A5.T4" title="In Appendix E Inductive Bias Ablations ‣ What Has a Foundation Model Found?Using Inductive Bias to Probe for World Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>), keeping the number of fine-tuning examples fixed to 100, and the number of fine-tuning examples (<a href="#A5.T5" title="In Appendix E Inductive Bias Ablations ‣ What Has a Foundation Model Found?Using Inductive Bias to Probe for World Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>), keeping the number of
fine-tuning iterations fixed to 100.</p>
</div>
