<td id="A7.T7.3.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><math id="A7.T7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{(1.04\pm 0.14)\cdot 10^{-7}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">1.04</mn><mo>±</mo><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">0.14</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn>𝟏𝟎</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>𝟕</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{(1.04\pm 0.14)\cdot 10^{-7}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A7.T7.3.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><math id="A7.T7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{(1.07\pm 0.11)\cdot 10^{-7}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">1.07</mn><mo>±</mo><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">0.11</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn>𝟏𝟎</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>𝟕</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{(1.07\pm 0.11)\cdot 10^{-7}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A7.T7.3.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><math id="A7.T7.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{(3.75\pm 0.56)\cdot 10^{-7}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">3.75</mn><mo>±</mo><mn class="ltx_mathvariant_bold" mathvariant="bold">0.56</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msup><mn>𝟏𝟎</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>𝟕</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{(3.75\pm 0.56)\cdot 10^{-7}}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A7.T7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="A7.T7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Orbit trajectory prediction performance (MSE) for models pre-trained on next-token prediction. Each column shows prediction accuracy when forecasting planetary positions 1, 5, or 100 time steps ahead from position 500 in the sequence. We compare the transformer model (trained on 6-month intervals) to two simple baselines (one that always predicts a planet’s position at the previous timestep, and another that uses the per-orbit mean). All results are evaluated on held-out test trajectories.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A8" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix H </span>What are models using to extrapolate?</h2>

